Manuel Rojas Foundation. Santiago – Chile, 27th of september 2015

---

**After 77 years, LOM reissued _“De la poesía a la revolución”_, this essay book of Manuel Rojas remains a central contribution to the Chilean theory and literary history, even today. In this collection of twelve key texts, Rojas expressed his views on poetry and literature, both Chilean and universal, and their relations with politics. The _Manuel Rojas Foundation_ was in charge of the annotation of the work, which brings it to new generations of readers of a multifaceted and ever-present Manuel Rojas. The author of the prologue is Grínor Rojo.**

